# =============================================================================
# Shared Status Files (conflict-prone auto-generated files)
# =============================================================================
# These files are auto-generated by workflows and would cause merge conflicts
# if multiple PRs commit them. Historical data is preserved in:
# - PR comments (completion summaries)
# - Workflow artifacts (full outputs)
# - Commit messages (change descriptions)

# --- Agent Working Files (HIGH conflict risk) ---
# Rebuilt every keepalive run; PR-specific variants prevent concurrent conflicts
codex-prompt.md
codex-output.md
codex-prompt-*.md
codex-output-*.md
verifier-context.md
verifier-diff-summary.md
pr_body.md
Issues.txt

# PR body file - regenerated by Codex CLI every round, causes merge conflicts
pr_body.md
!docs/pr_body.md

# --- Autofix Status Files (HIGH conflict risk) ---
# Updated by autofix workflow on every PR
autofix_report_enriched.json
.cosmetic-repair-summary.json
ci/autofix/history.json
ci/autofix/diagnostics.json

# --- Metrics/History Files (MEDIUM conflict risk - append-only) ---
# These accumulate data; prefer workflow artifacts over git commits
keepalive_status.md
docs/keepalive/status/
keepalive-metrics.ndjson
coverage-trend-history.ndjson
metrics-history.ndjson
metrics-retention.ndjson
residual-trend-history.ndjson
archives/metrics/

# --- Build and coverage artifacts ---
.autofix-venv/
coverage.xml

# --- Wrong package manager artifacts (defense-in-depth) ---
Pipfile.lock
poetry.lock

# --- Local repo-review output (ephemeral human decision packets) ---
docs/reports/repo-review/

# --- Local issue-completion dashboard cache (runtime artifact, regenerates) ---
docs/reports/issue_completion_dashboard.md
docs/reports/issue_completion_queue.tsv

# --- Repo-review pilot scratch dirs (one-off rollout artifacts; preserve via
#     archive snapshots under docs/reports/repo-review/archive/<date>/ instead) ---
docs/reports/repo-review-phase*/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
autofix_report_enriched.json
test_parser_debug.js
